            </profile>
            <profile id="51ae-cc28-7322-6353" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="15ea-5299-d0f5-5dbb" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, light armour and shield. Lance and warhorse if mounted. May have heavy armour (+1 pt). Mounted Latinikoi knights have Ferocious Charge, and may count their rank bonus up to +1. Komnenian armies: Latinikoi Cavalry may ride barded warhorses (+4 pts). Western knights were employed on a grand scale by Byzantine emperors, especially by Manuel I Komnenos. (Byzantium p.94)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="9649-5a20-a4a1-541b" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
