              <description>&lt;characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232"&gt;Hand weapon, shield, light armour and either Kontarion or Heavy Maces. Combined Formation - every other model may exchange Kontarion or Heavy Mace for bow, but may take no more equipment if they do so - archers are placed in the rear ranks.</description>
