              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon and a bow. May have throwing spear (+1 pt) or javelins (+1 pt), and a shield (+2 pts). Skirmishers. Nomad Cavalry. Komnenian armies only (Allies &amp; Mercenaries). (Byzantium p.95)</characteristic>
