            <profile id="2eeb-d790-b653-fe0b" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="15ea-5299-d0f5-5dbb" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, shield and bow. Heavy Cavalrymen also have light armour, throwing or thrusting spear, and may have heavy armour (+1 pt). Balkan Heavy Cavalry may count their rank bonus up to +1. Komnenian armies only (Allies &amp; Mercenaries). (Byzantium p.95)</characteristic>
